WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.460
Gainos.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.040
The ruling continent of the Queen's capital.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.330
For the purpose of becoming the new Queen, many warriors are aiming for that place.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.720
They place within their swords the feelings of ambition that are hidden within them.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.850
Thus, the burning competition, Queen's Blade, continues.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.400
A cheap sword such as yours...

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:09.210
is no match for a weapon of The Steel Mountain!

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.930
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.930
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.930
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:30.650
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:30.650
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:30.650
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:46.650
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:46.650
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:46.650
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:53.170
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:53.170
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:53.170
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:58.840
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:58.840
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:58.840
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.470
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.470
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.470
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:11.640
kotae wo shiritai

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:11.640
答えを知りたい

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:11.640
I want to know the answer

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:18.530
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:18.530
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:18.530
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:24.780
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:24.780
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:24.780
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:30.960
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:30.960
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:30.960
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:41.060
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:41.060
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:41.060
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:45.830
Good.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.700
<i>Our weapons aren't selling well?</i>

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.460
<i>The cheap metals from the alchemists are spreading, and weapon prices are dropping.</i>

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:10.620
<i>The Steel Mountain's high quality weapons stand no chance in this market.</i>

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:16.520
<i>It appears that weapons from Cattleya's shop in the Vosk village are selling well.</i>

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:20.360
<i>So she is our enemy, the source of those cheap weapons.</i>

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.670
Just you wait, Cattleya!

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:31.270
I, the Steel Princess, Ymir, won't let you get away with selling weapons of such poor quality!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:46.920
Well then, mommy needs to go deliver these weapons, so I'm leaving the shop to you.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.330
Ah, okay.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.590
I hope mommy comes back soon.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.310
Oh, my.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.880
Aren't you a spoiled little child.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.050
A girl called Leina...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.520
came here, didn't she?

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.680
Re-Leina?

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.060
Nanael, hurry up.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.780
I've had it.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.980
I'm so tired of this hill.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.220
You're flying, so it shouldn't matter, right?

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.620
I want to get to the village of Vosk right away.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:27.110
The renowned weaponsmith, Cattleya, is there, and I want to have this sword fixed.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.340
Really?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.330
Isn't that just terrible?

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:33.730
H-H-Hey!

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:34.690
What are you doing?

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:37.480
You're the one following me on your own, so don't complain.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.290
It's not like I want to be with you, either!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.550
There's barely any left.

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:45.800
I'll never forgive you for this!

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:45.800
Really?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.510
Isn't that just terrible?

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.850
It's all your fault in the first place.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.770
This is why I hate female apes!

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:57.850
Let's keep moving!

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:57.850
That's...

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:00.080
Come on, Nanael!

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.510
Um...

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.400
Excuse me.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:04.980
I'm Cattleya, a weaponsmith.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:08.570
This may be a bit rude, but do you think I could take a look at your sword?

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.490
Cattleya-san?

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.490
Yes.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.790
Those are huge!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.460
Hey.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:21.380
Is Leina really not here yet?

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:22.840
Yes.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:28.300
Oh well, I'll just have to keep waiting.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.300
Is this the store of the weaponsmith, Cattleya?

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.110
Yes, it is.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:36.210
Then are you Cattleya?!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:41.690
You seem to keep things tidy, but all you have are cheap metal weapons!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.110
I can easily tell that you don't spend anything for these.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:47.280
No matter where I look, all I see is plain merchandise.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.860
They all lack originality!

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:51.140
And you!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.580
You look too weak to be a weaponsmith.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:58.610
If you're a weaponsmith, you should at least train your body a little{fscx200}-

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.140
Who are you?!

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:02.290
What's so funny?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.250
Being a little cute is fine and all,

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.840
but being stupid on top of that is a bit ridiculous.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:09.930
What was that?

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.840
How could this child be Cattleya?

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:19.440
It's hard to believe that an idiot like you is the Dwarven Princess of The Steel Mountain.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.410
Then you're Cattleya?!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.020
You're pretty funny.

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.110
Both your looks and your actions are pretty crazy.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.680
Damn it, shut up!

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:31.560
Then who's Cattleya?

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:35.410
If you don't tell me, you'll feel the wrath of my battle axe!

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:37.030
Hey, you.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:39.080
What is that around your hip?

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.420
You have a problem with my underwear?

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.340
A snake!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.500
You're afraid of snakes?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:53.040
I-I'm not afraid of snakes.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:56.950
It's just that... those sticky and twitchy things

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.530
aren't so comfortable to think about.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.270
Or what I call disgusting.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:07.690
Or maybe just gross!

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.660
I hate snakes!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.160
I can't stand snakes!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.800
What exactly did she come here for?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.580
I'm home.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:24.820
Did something happen?

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.750
Mommy!

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:32.150
Long time no see, Princess Leina.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.050
You're...

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.520
So you were the daughter of Count Bansu.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:43.940
Then it's understandable why you have this sword.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:47.430
I forged this together with Od Owen.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:51.400
We forged it for Lady Maria under the request of Count Bansu.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.530
My father's request?

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.870
I knew it was my mother's favorite sword,

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.450
but I didn't know that.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.640
Impressive.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:02.580
A master swordsman has mastered a great sword.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.130
You made such a fine piece of work into junk.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:07.750
I'm joking.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.150
If you have time to glare at me,

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.810
at least learn how to take care of your weapons.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:21.100
Oh, man.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:21.920
That's right.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:23.120
This is bad.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.760
I need to do something.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:25.910
Goat milk.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.810
I have some cheap goat milk.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.230
It's very delicious.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.920
This is it!

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:32.940
Welcome.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.610
Hey miss, can I have this?

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:35.030
This one!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.580
Fill this all the way up.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:38.160
All right, thanks for buying.

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:41.160
Now I'm all set with the divine milk.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.610
I am so incredibly smart!

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:44.830
Here you go.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:45.950
Thank you!

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:49.500
Wh-What is this?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.350
That is our store's specialty,

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:55.170
the oh-so-popular grape flavored goat milk.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:57.300
I also recommend the orange flavored milk.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:02.010
Why the hell are you making something so useless!?

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:06.980
There, there.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.570
I had heard the rumors, but I'm still shocked.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:16.650
Cattleya the Giant Slayer is now a weaponsmith with a child.

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:20.700
I did have such a name once, didn't I?

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.370
Giant Slayer?

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:30.130
Everyone knew the fearful name of the Giant Slayer, Cattleya, who wielded a massive sword with ease.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:34.900
The Giant Slayer, together with the Dragon Sniper, Owen, is still a story to be told.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:38.050
I guess it was fate that they'd end up in love.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.350
Perhaps it was fate.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:44.310
We both retired here and opened a weapon store,

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.600
and we were even blessed with a child.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.300
With everyone's kindness, we're doing well with the store.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.240
I can't thank them enough.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.980
That's such a wonderful thing.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:59.200
Two people who fought alongside each other came to fall in love.

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:03.580
I'm sure it'll happen to you someday, as well.

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:04.900
Really?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:15.800
No!

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.930
I hate snakes!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.660
H-Help me, guys.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:23.550
Snakes!

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:24.190
Snake-

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.670
I had fallen asleep?

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:41.720
What a dreadful nightmare that was.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.560
You were so loud.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.810
You country folks are so loud, I can't stand it.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:46.240
Hey!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.030
Are you an angel?

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:49.950
What do you want?

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.960
I don't have any business with you.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.560
I'm looking for goat milk.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.660
Milk that's not orange or grape.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:56.460
Oh.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.840
I have some left over, you can have it if you want.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.460
Really?!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.960
Maybe you're not so bad after all.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:08.100
It's a new product, the strawberry goat milk!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.850
You stupid, stupid idiot!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.100
This is why I can't stand female apes.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:16.360
You're also pretty loud when you talk.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.260
It seems that there are some strange animals here.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.280
That's great, but Tomoe-sama,

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:31.960
I don't think we'll be getting to the Queen's capital without an actual map.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.950
Yes, you're right...

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.170
Are you looking for a map?

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.680
I can sell you one.

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:43.780
Though it'll be a little expensive.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.970
What do you think of Cattleya?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.150
She's a magnificent person.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:59.610
She's an excellent warrior, has a well reputed store, and she's raising a child.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.440
She seems really happy.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:04.480
You don't understand anything.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:05.990
What don't I understand?

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:10.490
Cattleya hates herself for not being able to make up her mind.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:16.770
Dear, please come back soon.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:21.610
Both him... and I... feel so lonely.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:26.840
Two years ago, Owen left those two and disappeared.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:27.760
Disappeared?

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:29.800
Completely vanished.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.560
He could have been killed by a beast,

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:35.240
or maybe he's with another woman.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:35.940
That's...

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:41.600
If she goes out to find him, then her child will be in danger.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:46.240
But she can't just forget about him and marry another man, even if it's for her son.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.530
Compared to her, you have it easy.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.310
You just do whatever you want every day.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.170
Whatever I want?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.090
I'm living on the edge every-

00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:58.330
On the edge?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.040
I think you mean living in happiness.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.250
I'm on an adventure!

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.920
I face tons of danger!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.700
Really?

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.310
Danger comes with any roadtrip.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:14.170
Even if you say that...

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:17.310
I don't actually know what to do.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:23.030
That's why I was trying to find Risty, and then...

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.110
Then what?

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.810
I won't know until I see her.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:32.260
But when I meet with Risty, then surely...

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.800
You're such a helpless girl.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:39.290
Just keep aiming for Gainos, the Queen's capital.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:42.130
Risty is also going there.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.370
A goat...

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:48.970
A purple goat is coming!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.360
Now a pink one!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.140
Since we've finally been reunited...

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.250
I mustn't fall asleep.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.320
A snake will come.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.660
I hate snakes.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:09.240
I hate...

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.910
I can't... Ah!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:13.870
That's...

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.620
the snake woman!

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:21.950
I'll hold out on the last bit of fun.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:26.210
I'll just patiently wait to see how you'll respond.

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:33.640
It looks like the snake woman fears my hidden power.

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.820
Are you the real Cattleya?

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.100
Yes, that would be me.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:48.470
We're not yet open for business, but if it's urgent, I can{fscx200}-

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:49.900
Shut up, shut up!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.230
I am Ymir, the Steel Princess!

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:55.150
I came for a fight as a competitor in the market.

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:58.830
I can't forgive a store that sells nothing but cheap weapons!

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:01.160
My, you're from The Steel Mountain?

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:07.450
Our motto is to sell affordable, quality weapons.

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:11.380
Though they're hardly comparable to the high quality weapons you make.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.980
Well, that's true.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.030
The quality of our weapons is unmatched on this continent.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:22.290
Not just anyone can carry one around.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:26.200
I already know that much!

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.290
Now, let's fight!

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:31.150
What a magnificent battle axe.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.670
So this is what a weapon from The Steel Mountain feels like.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:38.700
Seeing such amazing work teaches me so much.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.020
Oh, you understand well.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:44.500
This battle axe, you see, has small details all the way down to the handle, and{fscx200}-

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.960
You're a smart talker to be able to deceive me!

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:51.240
I won't be fooled anymore.

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:53.880
I demand that you pick up a weapon and fight!

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:55.530
Miss!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.890
Miss Leina!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:58.820
It's terrible!

00:15:58.820 --> 00:15:59.810
Mommy is...

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.470
Cattleya-san?

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.780
Why?!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.240
There, there!

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.100
And more, more!

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.510
Why, you...

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.050
Cattleya-san.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.300
Why aren't you attacking? Fight!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.360
Please forgive me.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.880
I'm nothing more than a weaponsmith.

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:40.850
I have no will to fight.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.460
Even if you don't, I do!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:45.100
Take this!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.100
Miss, please help Mommy.

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:53.190
It's still under repair.

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:56.080
Isn't there anything else I can use?

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:08.170
Mommy!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.710
Rana, go back inside.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:11.540
No!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.250
I want to stay by your side!

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:15.540
I won't hold back, even with a child.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.220
Now, take your weapon, Cattleya.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:19.450
<i>I can't.</i>

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:23.260
<i>If I start fighting now, I'll involve him in an endless world of battles.</i>

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:24.720
<i>But...</i>

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.750
<i>If I enter Queen's Blade, maybe I'll find Owen some day.</i>

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:30.940
Cattleya-san.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.860
Please use this!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.730
<i>Giant Slayer.</i>

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:45.240
Cattleya-san.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:47.660
<i>You can't spend your life just standing still.</i>

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:51.920
<i>Only your own resolve can cut open a path through fate.</i>

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:56.590
Mommy.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:58.880
Please, fight.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:03.970
I'm not afraid of anything if I can be with you.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.390
So please.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.520
Fight!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.230
Rana.

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:32.500
The Weaponsmith, Cattleya, is entering battle!

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:35.600
So you're finally in the mood.

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.180
Now I can go at full strength.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:45.600
What's going on so early in the morning?

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:47.600
Wait a minute.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:50.380
The angel, Nanael, will watch over this fight.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.980
God of the heavens, may you watch over us.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:56.230
Warriors who wish to take part in Queen's Blade,

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:59.630
prove your skills as warriors, here in this place.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.570
Then shall the door open to test your strength.

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:04.850
The warriors are Steel Princess, Ymir,

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.200
and Weaponsmith, Cattleya!

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:11.100
Even better if it's broadcast through Queen's Blade.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:13.690
I'll show you the power...

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.040
of The Steel Mountain's weapons!

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:25.230
Please watch me fight together with my son, Owen!

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.070
Amazing.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:44.170
How dare you.

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:46.180
But I'm still not done.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.870
N-No way!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.830
My battle axe...

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.870
This battle is over!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.550
The victory goes to Weaponsmith, Cattleya!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:06.270
If your weapon breaks in a one-on-one duel, you must listen to anything your opponent says.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:09.000
This is the dwarven code, correct?

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:10.470
Right.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:13.930
The weapons from The Steel Mountain are beautiful in their raw form.

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:17.150
Please promise me that you'll never try something like this again.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.360
I shall make that promise.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.030
Then let's forget what happened.

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:25.560
You haven't eaten breakfast yet, have you?

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.120
Would you care to join us?

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.570
Yes, I shall.

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:29.330
Good.

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:33.030
I hope you're not picky, Ymir-chan.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:36.920
You're still growing, so you need to eat as much as you can.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:40.170
I'm older than you, though...

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:45.560
What?!

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:49.760
Wow.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.770
I also adjusted its center of gravity.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:57.540
That sword has my husband's soul forged into it.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:00.060
Please take good care of it.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.360
I will.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.640
Also, here's something for you, Miss Angel.

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:08.000
I heard that you were looking around for this.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:10.870
What flavor is this?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:11.860
Banana?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.080
Coffee?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.840
Oh, no.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.610
That's just the normal one.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.800
My dearest friend!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.090
Okay, let's go, Nanael.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.050
Woohoo!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.270
Risty!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.590
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.410
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuru

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.410 --> 00:22:01.130
I can't express my overflowing feelings well

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
kizutsuita sono bun dake

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
傷ついたその分だけ

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.060
Hurting will, to an extent,

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
tsuyoku narerundato kigatsuite

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
強くなれるんだと気がついて

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.230
Make you realize how much stronger you can become

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
takaku tooku ton demiseru

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
高く遠く飛んでみせる

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:24.310
You can fly high and far away

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
hisoka ni jibun to chikatta

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
密かに自分と誓った

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:29.200
Surely and secretly for yourself

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
kiseki wa itsumo dareka no kimagure

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
奇跡はいつも誰かの気まぐれ

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:37.580
Miracles are always fickle for everyone

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
onnaji sora no shitani aru nara

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
おんなじ空の下にあるなら

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.460
If we are under the same sky

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
keshite akirametari shinai

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
けして諦めたりしない

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:49.200
We will never give up

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
wasurenai kara ano hi no koto

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
忘れないからあの日のこと

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.460
I won't forget about that day

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
donna ni jikan ga tattemo

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
どんなに時間が経っても

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:59.180
No matter how much time passes by

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afuretekuru

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:08.050
Confusing feelings overflow in my heart

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:15.390
Hello, hello!

00:23:15.390 --> 00:23:17.410
It is I, the glorious angel, Nanael.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:20.450
I knew a day like this would come eventually.

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.540
Next time, I'll be annoucing Queen's Blade like crazy!

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:25.130
Nanael's going to be on a roll.

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:27.000
Truly an act of legend.

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.950
My overwhelming presense.

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:31.640
I'm not just amazing, but cute, cool, and awesome!

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:35.890
I think we can say for sure that Nanael will be the next Head Angel, right?

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.040
Oh, what am I saying? Kyaa!

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:40.110
Next time: Enlightenment ~ Dragon Blow!

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:43.400
Oh yeah, a female ape proclaims lewdness, or something.
